      "sc-intro": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 40,
          "title": "",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": true,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "**Source:** Claude Code's native OpenTelemetry log events, sent over OTLP into **Loki**: `user_prompt`, `assistant_response`, `tool_result` and `api_request`. Prompt, response and tool content appear because content logging is switched on by the gateway managed settings (`content_capture`) (`OTEL_LOG_USER_PROMPTS`, `OTEL_LOG_ASSISTANT_RESPONSES`, `OTEL_LOG_TOOL_CONTENT`).  \nPick a session in the *Session* picker (or click any session id) to read one conversation as the developer and the agent had it.",
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "sc-transcript": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 41,
          "title": "Conversation transcript",
          "description": "user_prompt, assistant_response and tool_result events in order.",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [
                {
                  "kind": "PanelQuery",
                  "spec": {
                    "refId": "A",
                    "hidden": false,
                    "query": {
                      "kind": "DataQuery",
                      "group": "loki",
                      "version": "v0",
                      "datasource": {
                        "name": "${ds_logs}"
                      },
                      "spec": {
                        "editorMode": "code",
                        "expr": "{service_name=\"claude-code\", service_namespace=\"${prefix}\"} | user_groups=~\"$team\" | user_email=~\"$user\" | session_id=~\"$session\" | event_name=~\"user_prompt|assistant_response|tool_result\" | label_format detected_level=`{{ if eq .event_name \"user_prompt\" }}info{{ else if eq .event_name \"assistant_response\" }}debug{{ else }}trace{{ end }}` | line_format `{{ if eq .event_name \"user_prompt\" }}PROMPT    {{ .prompt }}{{ else if eq .event_name \"assistant_response\" }}RESPONSE  {{ .response }}{{ else }}TOOL      {{ .tool_name }} {{ .tool_parameters }} {{ .tool_input }} ({{ .duration_ms }} ms, success={{ .success }}){{ end }}`",
                        "legendFormat": "",
                        "queryType": "range",
                        "maxLines": 500,
                        "direction": "forward",
                        "refId": "A"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              ],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "logs",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "showTime": true,
                "showLabels": false,
                "showCommonLabels": false,
                "wrapLogMessage": true,
                "prettifyLogMessage": false,
                "enableLogDetails": true,
                "enableInfiniteScrolling": false,
                "dedupStrategy": "none",
                "sortOrder": "Ascending",
                "syntaxHighlighting": true,
                "fontSize": "default",
                "detailsMode": "inline"
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "sc-prompts": {
