      "pv-overview": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 74,
          "title": "How the data gets here",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "### Three independent paths, one Grafana Cloud stack\n\nEvery panel on this dashboard reads one of the signals below. The gateway pushes Claude Code's OpenTelemetry settings to every signed-in developer, and the agento11y plugin adds a second, independent view through Claude Code's hooks. The two can be switched on separately, which is also why they can disagree: always check both paths.\n\n```\n Agent host (developer containers)                          Grafana Cloud\n ---------------------------------                          ----------------------------------------------\n Claude Code  (settings pushed by the gateway)\n   native OpenTelemetry  --- OTLP via gateway forward_to -->  OTLP gateway\n                                                              |--> Mimir   metrics: cost, tokens, sessions, active time\n                                                              |--> Loki    events:  prompts, responses, tool calls,\n                                                              |                     API requests, hooks, MCP connections\n                                                              '--> Tempo   traces:  claude_code.interaction and children\n\n   agento11y plugin (hooks) --------------------------------> Agent Observability: conversations, generations,\n                                                                Cloud guards (deny, redact, warn), online evaluations\n Claude apps gateway audit log -- host Alloy -------------->  Loki    service_name=${svc_gateway}\n Gateway spend store (Postgres) -- PDC agent ------------->  Postgres datasource ${ds_spend}\n```\n",
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "pv-paths": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 75,
          "title": "Signal paths",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "| Path | Signal | Lands in | What you see here | Key attributes |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Claude Code native OTel | Metrics | Mimir | Spend, tokens, sessions, active time (*Overview*, *Cost & tokens*, MCP spend) | `user_groups`, `user_email`, `model`, `session_id`, `mcp_server_name`, `mcp_tool_name`, `effort`, `query_source` |\n| Claude Code native OTel | Log events | Loki | `user_prompt`, `assistant_response`, `tool_result`, `tool_decision`, `api_request`, `hook_execution_*`, `mcp_server_connection`, `plugin_loaded` | every event carries `session_id`, `user_email`, `user_groups`; content fields when enabled |\n| Claude Code native OTel | Traces (enhanced telemetry, beta) | Tempo | `claude_code.interaction` per prompt, with `llm_request` and `tool` child spans (*Traces*) | `session.id`, `user.email`, `ttft_ms`, `stop_reason` |\n| agento11y Claude Code plugin | Conversations and generations | Agent Observability | Full conversations, evaluations and scores | `agent_name=claude-code`, conversation id = Claude Code session id |\n| agento11y Claude Code plugin | Traces | Tempo | `generateText <model>` and `execute_tool` spans under `service.name=agento11y` | `gen_ai.*` semantic conventions, `gen_ai.conversation.id` |\n| agento11y Cloud guards | Allow / deny / redact decisions | Mimir (`agento11y_hook_rule_outcomes_total`) | *OpenTelemetry + Agent Observability plugin* tab | rule ids `${cc_guard_re}` |\n| Claude apps gateway | Audit log | Loki | *Gateway audit log* tab | `service_name=${svc_gateway}`, `evt` |\n| Claude apps gateway | Spend store | Postgres over PDC | *Gateway spend* tab | `spend`, `spend_limits`, `admin_audit` |\n",
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "pv-env": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 76,
          "title": "Settings that switch each signal on",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": false,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "| Setting (pushed by the gateway managed settings) | What it switches on |\n|---|---|\n| `CLAUDE_CODE_ENABLE_TELEMETRY=1` and the OTLP exporters | Claude Code telemetry at all (the gateway sets these through `telemetry.forward_to`) |\n| `OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_METRICS_TEMPORALITY_PREFERENCE=cumulative` | Short sessions still leave a sample behind |\n| `OTEL_RESOURCE_ATTRIBUTES=service.namespace=${prefix}` | Scopes every metric, event and span to this demo |\n| `OTEL_LOG_TOOL_DETAILS=1` | Real MCP server and tool names (otherwise `custom`) and tool arguments |\n| `OTEL_LOG_USER_PROMPTS=1`, `OTEL_LOG_ASSISTANT_RESPONSES=1`, `OTEL_LOG_TOOL_CONTENT=1` | Prompt, response and tool content in the log events (`content_capture`) |\n| `CLAUDE_CODE_ENHANCED_TELEMETRY_BETA=1` | `claude_code.*` traces |\n| `AGENTO11Y_TAGS=${cc_tag_key}=${prefix}` | Scopes the agento11y plugin's generations, guards and evaluations to this demo |\n| `AGENTO11Y_GUARDS_ENABLED=true` | Cloud guards on every prompt and tool call |\n",
                "code": {
                  "language": "plaintext",
                  "showLineNumbers": false,
                  "showMiniMap": false
                }
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "pv-notes": {
