      "pl-intro": {
        "kind": "Panel",
        "spec": {
          "id": 224,
          "title": "",
          "description": "",
          "links": [],
          "transparent": true,
          "data": {
            "kind": "QueryGroup",
            "spec": {
              "queries": [],
              "transformations": [],
              "queryOptions": {}
            }
          },
          "vizConfig": {
            "kind": "VizConfig",
            "group": "text",
            "version": "",
            "spec": {
              "options": {
                "mode": "markdown",
                "content": "**Source: Claude Code OpenTelemetry plus the Agent Observability (agento11y) plugin.** Force-enable it from managed settings (`extraKnownMarketplaces` + `enabledPlugins`, pushable by the gateway policy); the `agento11y` CLI must be installed on the machine. It turns every Claude Code turn into an Agent Observability **conversation** with generations and subagents, sends each tool call through **Cloud guards** (deny, redact, warn) before it runs, and makes sessions available to **online evaluations**. Open *Observability > Agent > Agents > claude-code* for the conversation view."
              },
              "fieldConfig": {
                "defaults": {},
                "overrides": []
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
